Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
Shape 3: spherical-harmonic perturbations, from no torque to orbits\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"579174ba-b5ca-4775-901b-2a0aba8169ae"],

Cell["\<\
Adding harmonics to a sphere one degree at a time, to find the simplest \
surface chiral enough to spin and orbit\
\>", "Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"5a53b434-d7b9-4ba2-990b-c938d1dec90e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The body is a sphere whose radius is perturbed by real spherical harmonics, \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"R", "(", 
    OverscriptBox["n", "^"], ")", " ", "=", " ", "1", " ", "+", " ", 
    "\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ", "s", "(", 
    OverscriptBox["n", "^"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "85d2ef6c-a04b-41f1-bfd5-ff2419597a4b"],
 " (units of the mean radius ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["l", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8858a232-0335-43dc-8d23-eb71027eb2c9"],
 "), with uniform density. Shapes 1 and 2 showed that neither an ellipsoid \
nor an ellipsoid with an offset centre of mass (CoM) can spin: the chirality \
has to be in the surface. This notebook climbs the harmonic ladder. It first \
uses symmetry to show where a spin-driving torque can first appear, then \
confirms each step with the exact perturbation engine. Finally it builds the \
simplest shape that spins, and the simplest that orbits. As before the \
gradient is uniform, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Del]", 
    StyleBox["ln",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], " ", "T", " ", "=", " ", "-", "G", 
    OverscriptBox["Z", "^"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "753fa900-cb6f-43db-973b-219f0d33b85b"],
 ", with no trap."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"43030815-600f-4adf-8044-8e218c4f1459"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Results in brief.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (1) The thermophoretic torque about the CoM vanishes at first order for \
every harmonic. At second order it comes only from products of harmonics of \
neighbouring degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["l", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "aa492f8b-0f20-4b43-8ff4-72573a6aa865"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "da765be9-ec92-46f6-9988-564bd64a4130"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "\[GreaterEqual]", " ", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"3621b71c-5174-42a4-88f1-15b0a8aba09c"],
 "; the simplest is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
    "l", " ", "=", " ", "2", " ", "\[Times]", " ", "l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d72d738f-4c60-4c1c-9c97-8c0d7f0d8bd6"],
 ". (2) The degrees taken singly give nothing useful. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "370ebf27-35a5-4f2f-912c-461ca5f5fa88"],
 " is just a displaced sphere, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7bebb39d-f33a-49d2-89dd-e142402eab69"],
 " is the ellipsoid of Shape 1. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5a06f652-a77d-49b5-a40f-59830e9d2440"],
 " alone has no symmetric (spin-driving) torque until ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "5"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"e4f2d45a-b432-4320-bd25-aaa45b6fa079"],
 ". (3) ",
 StyleBox["Ellipsoid + ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"x", "y", "z"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9fd563b1-6b1d-4950-83ed-4563aa76a72a"],
 StyleBox[" twist",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["D", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ddceb495-55d7-4880-9d9b-b10830b43495"],
 ", chiral) gives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     StyleBox["th",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", "\[Proportional]", " ", "b", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    StyleBox["diag",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "(", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"y", "y"}]], " ", "-", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"z", "z"}]], ",", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"z", "z"}]], " ", "-", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"x", "x"}]], ",", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"x", "x"}]], " ", "-", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", 
     RowBox[{"y", "y"}]], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2393f181-6160-403b-8e8c-9fa4bd0357a2"],
 ". It ",
 StyleBox["spins steadily",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " about a principal axis, but by symmetry it cannot orbit. (4) ",
 StyleBox["Tilting the ellipsoid relative to the twist",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (symmetry ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1a05506f-6ded-49ce-95fc-a5ccd4ced1aa"],
 ") leaves the stable spin axis off every symmetry axis, and the particle ",
 StyleBox["orbits",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ", "=", " ", "0.1"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"f764a0d4-af21-42d5-b09d-df03759a497e"],
 ", a 20\[Degree] tilt and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"b", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "638bcdc7-a62a-4043-a047-0642ecf3dfe9"],
 " on a 20 \[Micro]m, 1 g/cm\.b3 particle at 5 Torr: ",
 StyleBox["radius 24.5 \[Micro]m, period 0.436 s, clockwise seen from above",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". (5) To leading order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"R", " ", "\[Proportional]", " ", "l", "/", "\[CurlyEpsilon]"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"7ff8c7d9-5a7f-4497-b7b7-9ae8e9316265"],
 ", independent of pressure and particle density, while the period scales as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"P", "/", "(", 
    SubscriptBox["\[Rho]", "p"], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"173acada-d954-4939-9ec8-ae5e2afd74a4"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{3, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.35, 0.55, 0.85],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.96, 0.97, 1.],ExpressionUUID->"c3e1adca-a5a3-4318-8c19-fb3df74fb8af"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Setup", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5071f349-672c-44b1-a4d8-df40943e9002"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"shapesDir", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Quiet", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Check", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], ",", "$Failed"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"If", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"!", 
     RowBox[{"StringQ", "[", "shapesDir", "]"}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"shapesDir", "=", 
     RowBox[{"Environment", "[", "\"\<SHAPES_DIR\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Get", "[", 
   RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"shapesDir", ",", "\"\<ShapeLevitation.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], 
   "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"$verifications", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"record", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref_", ",", "claim_", ",", "status_", ",", "detail_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
      RowBox[{"$verifications", ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", "status", ",", "detail"}], "}"}]}], 
      "]"}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"VR", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", "status", ",", "detail"}], "]"}]}], 
    ")"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"VR", "/:", 
   RowBox[{"MakeBoxes", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"VR", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ref_", ",", "claim_", ",", "status_", ",", "detail_"}], "]"}], 
     ",", "fmt_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"ToBoxes", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Panel", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
             RowBox[{"status", ",", "Bold", ",", 
              RowBox[{"If", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"status", "==", "\"\<VERIFIED\>\""}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"Darker", "[", "Green", "]"}], ",", "Red"}], "]"}]}], 
             "]"}], ",", "\"\<   \>\"", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
             RowBox[{"ref", ",", "Bold"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<:  \>\"", ",", 
            "claim"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"If", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"detail", "===", "\"\<\>\""}], ",", "Nothing", ",", 
           "detail"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "fmt"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"check", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref_String", ",", "claim_String", ",", "test_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"detail_", ":", "\"\<\>\""}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"record", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ref", ",", "claim", ",", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "test", "]"}], ",", "\"\<VERIFIED\>\"", 
       ",", "\"\<DISCREPANCY\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "detail"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", "expr_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "expr", "]"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
     "PossibleZeroQ"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x", "==", "0"}], ",", "\"\<0\>\"", ",", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"e", "=", 
         RowBox[{"Floor", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Log10", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
            RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
         RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], "/", 
            RowBox[{"10", "^", "e"}]}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"3", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "<>", "\"\<e\>\"",
         "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "e", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"num", "[", 
    RowBox[{"x_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"d_", ":", "4"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"x", "!=", "0"}], "&&", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "x", "]"}], "<", 
         RowBox[{"10", "^", 
          RowBox[{"-", "3"}]}]}], "||", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "x", "]"}], ">=", 
         RowBox[{"10", "^", "5"}]}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"sci", "[", "x", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
      RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"N", "[", "x", "]"}], ",", "d"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"vec", "[", 
    RowBox[{"v_", ",", 
     RowBox[{"d_", ":", "3"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<(\>\"", "<>", 
    RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"num", "[", 
         RowBox[{"#", ",", "d"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", 
       RowBox[{"Chop", "[", 
        RowBox[{"v", ",", 
         RowBox[{"10", "^", 
          RowBox[{"-", "9"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\"\<, \>\""}], "]"}], 
    "<>", "\"\<)\>\""}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"tf", "[", "m_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
    RowBox[{"MatrixForm", "[", "m", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"n", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"r2", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}], "+", 
    RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"gas", "=", 
   RowBox[{"gasModel", "[", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"ell", "=", "20*^-6"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"rhoP", "=", "1000."}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"toR", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sexpr_", ",", "e_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "f", "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"f", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Function", "@@", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", "+", 
            RowBox[{"e", "sexpr"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"f", "@@", "#"}], "&"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"uLab", "[", "st_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
     RowBox[{"quatR", "[", 
      RowBox[{"st", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", 
        RowBox[{"7", ";;", "10"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ".", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",Expression\
UUID->"c2d0f93b-17e6-4057-96b6-ce8079c3025b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. The shapes", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"52b90053-9e56-4c7e-9468-7b9bff00c95e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The surface is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["r",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], " ", "=", " ", "l", " ", "R", "(", 
    OverscriptBox["n", "^"], ")", 
    OverscriptBox["n", "^"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c07d88fe-c6ac-48f8-81f0-650562d3da8e"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox["n", "^"], " ", "=", " ", "(", "x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ",
     "z", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a77182de-da9b-4ba6-adb7-ce7678346d86"],
 " the unit direction:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"560f9c95-2323-454b-a8c2-d2eb8994f50a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Rharm", "[", "s_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"1", "+", 
    RowBox[{"eps", "s"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Y1", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Y2", "[", "Q_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"n", ".", "Q", ".", "n"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Y3", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"x", "y", "z"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"z", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], "-", 
        RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"x", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], "-", 
        RowBox[{"3", 
         RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}]}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"y", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"3", 
         RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}]}], "-", 
        RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"x", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"5", 
         RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "-", "r2"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"y", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"5", 
         RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "-", "r2"}], ")"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"z", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"5", 
         RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], "-", 
        RowBox[{"3", "r2"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<R(n) = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Rharm", "[", "s", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<l = 3 basis: \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", "Y3", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<harmonic\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<the l = 3 basis polynomials are harmonic (zero Laplacian), so \
each is a pure l = 3 spherical harmonic\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Laplacian", "[", 
          RowBox[{"#", ",", "n"}], "]"}], "&"}], "/@", "Y3"}], "]"}]}], 
     "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"3e1ab5b0-f6de-43f8-\
b390-29fbc035c851"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{"\"R(n) = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"eps", " ", "s"}], "+", "1"}], TraditionalForm], 
    TraditionalForm, Editable -> True]},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"a14ff66b-cbef-43f9-b1f6-\
cde4d245f5ae"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{"\"l = 3 basis: \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"x", " ", "y", " ", "z"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"z", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "-", 
               SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"x", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "-", 
               RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                 SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"y", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                 SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}], "-", 
               SuperscriptBox["y", "2"]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"x", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", 
                 RowBox[{
                   SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}]}], "-", 
               SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], "+", 
               RowBox[{"4", " ", 
                 SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"y", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", 
                 RowBox[{
                   SuperscriptBox["x", "2"]}]}], "-", 
               SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], "+", 
               RowBox[{"4", " ", 
                 SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}]}], ")"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"z", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"5", " ", 
                 SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}], "-", 
               RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"(", 
                   RowBox[{
                    SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], "+", 
                    SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], "+", 
                    SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}], ")"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}], 
     TraditionalForm], TraditionalForm, Editable -> True]},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"dedd397d-e97d-489f-a5a7-\
917a006cfd76"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["\[Checkmark] VERIFIED",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15]],
 "    ",
 StyleBox["harmonic",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ":   ",
 "the l = 3 basis polynomials are harmonic (zero Laplacian), so each is a \
pure l = 3 spherical harmonic"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{4, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellMargins->{{66, 10}, {4, 4}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.92, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"f185519f-bf84-4412-8312-29083af59af9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2526d36c-493a-4150-b132-f345fdae9dfd"],
 " polynomials are written homogeneously (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["r", "2"], " ", "=", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["x", "2"], " ", "+", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["y", "2"], " ", "+", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["z", "2"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5391e6d8-dbc6-47ce-b1bc-2a6e73849754"],
 ", which equals 1 on the surface) so that the Laplacian test applies. The \
shapes studied, in order, are:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ba7e688f-fe0e-4799-9402-0a8715334f47"],

Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {"step", 
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{"s", "(", 
      OverscriptBox["n", "^"], ")"}],
     TraditionalForm], "symmetry", "result"},
   {"1", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox["z",
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", "("}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}],
      TraditionalForm], ")"}], 
    FormBox[
     SubscriptBox["C", 
      RowBox[{"\[Infinity]", " ", "v"}]],
     TraditionalForm], 
    RowBox[{"a", " ", "displaced", " ", 
     RowBox[{"sphere", ":", " ", 
      RowBox[{"no", " ", "torque"}]}]}]},
   {"2", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox["n", "^"], "\[Transpose]"], 
       StyleBox["Q",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], 
       OverscriptBox["n", "^"]}],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", "("}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "2"}],
      TraditionalForm], ")"}], 
    FormBox[
     SubscriptBox["D", 
      RowBox[{"2", "h"}]],
     TraditionalForm], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"the", " ", "ellipsoid", " ", "of", " ", "Shape", " ", "1"}], ":",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"no", " ", "torque"}]}]},
   {"3", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["\[Sum]", "m"], " ", 
       SubscriptBox["c", "m"], " ", 
       SubscriptBox["Y", 
        RowBox[{"3", "m"}]]}],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", "("}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}],
      TraditionalForm], ")"}], "generic", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"no", " ", "spin", " ", "torque", " ", "until", " "}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"O", "(", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "5"], ")"}],
      TraditionalForm]}]},
   {"4", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox["n", "^"], "\[Transpose]"], 
       StyleBox["Q",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], 
       OverscriptBox["n", "^"], " ", "+", " ", "b", "\[ThinSpace]", "x", "y", 
       "z"}],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", "("}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "2", " ", "+", " ", "3"}],
      TraditionalForm], ")"}], "general", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"first", " ", "chiral", " ", "torque"}], ",", " "}], 
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{"O", "(", 
       SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], ")"}],
      TraditionalForm]}]},
   {"5", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox["n", "^"], "\[Transpose]"], 
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["Q",
         FontWeight->"Bold"], "0"], 
       OverscriptBox["n", "^"], " ", "+", " ", "b", "\[ThinSpace]", "x", "y", 
       "z"}],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{",", " "}], 
     FormBox[
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["Q",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "0"],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", "diagonal"}]}], 
    FormBox[
     SubscriptBox["D", "2"],
     TraditionalForm], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"steady", " ", "spin"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"no", " ", "orbit"}]}]},
   {"6", 
    RowBox[{
     FormBox[
      RowBox[{
       SuperscriptBox[
        OverscriptBox["n", "^"], "\[Transpose]"], 
       StyleBox["Q",
        FontWeight->"Bold"], "(", "\[Chi]", ")", 
       OverscriptBox["n", "^"], " ", "+", " ", "b", "\[ThinSpace]", "x", "y", 
       "z"}],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{",", " "}], 
     FormBox[
      StyleBox["Q",
       FontWeight->"Bold"],
      TraditionalForm], 
     RowBox[{" ", 
      RowBox[{"tilted", " ", "by", " "}]}], 
     FormBox["\[Chi]",
      TraditionalForm]}], 
    FormBox[
     SubscriptBox["C", "2"],
     TraditionalForm], 
    RowBox[{"steady", " ", "spin", " ", "and", " ", "circular", " ", "orbit"}]}
  },
  GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
  GridBoxBackground->{"Rows" -> {
      RGBColor[0.9, 0.93, 0.97], None}},
  GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
  GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{1}}, "Rows" -> {{0.6}}}]],
 FontFamily->
  "Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->"f6853275-6c54-4f0d-8a70-acca9b8db6fb"]], \
"Text",ExpressionUUID->"fbdf3ded-e931-41ce-87bd-5fcad61d9c60"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Where a spin torque can come from: selection rules", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5ade5ab4-31f2-43e5-ac75-4c70f3f24cf5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A steady spin about the vertical needs a real, non-zero eigenvalue of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     StyleBox["drag",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["T",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     StyleBox["th",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "227c12ec-ca47-4a41-84ce-03b9e7901661"],
 ", which in practice means a symmetric part of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "970993a4-2a5a-479c-a7b3-24d841036125"],
 " about the CoM. Two symmetry facts decide where that can first appear."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e027b7ab-0aaa-425b-a7a8-bfac3e796d5e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Parity.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "15cc1735-b065-4be0-9800-afb4fecae758"],
 " maps a polar vector (the gradient) to an axial vector (the torque), so it \
changes sign under inversion. Inversion multiplies a degree-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["l", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f3f2c109-3985-47dc-aecb-1ae7666011c6"],
 " harmonic by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", "-", "1", ")"}], "l"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e7372a69-1572-4927-9965-56e19a6e3105"],
 ". A term of order ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "k"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ce3ede7f-09a2-4241-8c8c-5d7de33854ca"],
 " built from harmonics ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["l", "1"], ",", " ", "\[Ellipsis]", ",", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["l", "k"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "08b3d814-ce6a-4ffc-99bf-79890935ac6e"],
 " can therefore contribute only if ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["l", "1"], " ", "+", " ", "\[CenterEllipsis]", " ", "+", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["l", "k"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "907a16f0-e5a4-4b35-924f-db417d3c8f41"],
 " is odd."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"31621236-59b2-4331-b606-4f1765d23a26"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rank.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06c55beb-b208-459c-8099-a55472523dd8"],
 " is a rank-2 tensor: its trace, antisymmetric part and symmetric traceless \
part carry angular momentum 0, 1 and 2. A term linear in one harmonic of \
degree ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["l", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0110945b-a7be-4271-8ba4-f70a4bfe93e7"],
 " can contribute only if ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "\[LessEqual]", " ", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"43efa3f6-3bfe-4951-af7c-d24d7abbe5ec"],
 ". Combined with parity, only ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "04f615c9-b5e4-46a1-bf29-d27ab30d1bce"],
 " survives, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "68489f9a-c14d-46bc-8c54-3a9bf133893c"],
 " is a rigid translation that moves the CoM along with the surface. So ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["T",
       FontWeight->"Bold"], 
      StyleBox["th",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", "=", " ", "O", "(", 
     SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], ")"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a05a0263-95ed-4088-b100-a98df42ac357"],
 StyleBox[" about the CoM for any uniform-density shape.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c10869ac-9df4-40c3-bb89-99c790af31c3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Second order.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A product of degrees ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["l", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e6a152a3-390c-4e9d-8e1a-db276a8f65c5"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", "'"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "53588f78-1fd4-447f-b975-9571df74bdd9"],
 " needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "+", " ", "l", "'"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6d602802-9aea-4e0c-8a54-c6e24538b2dc"],
 " odd and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
   "|", "l", " ", "-", " ", "l", "'", "|", " ", "\[LessEqual]", " ", "2"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"4d598e49-24fc-40f2-9d90-fdd0e4034884"],
 ", so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", "'", " ", "=", " ", "l", " ", "\[PlusMinus]", " ", "1"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"ae176d97-34f1-4fe0-8d9e-033427001e01"],
 ". Products involving ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "da389cc0-1a2f-4baa-8de5-46361798030e"],
 " are translations of the lower-order shape. The ",
 StyleBox["simplest chiral pair is ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{
    "l", " ", "=", " ", "2", " ", "\[Times]", " ", "l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "74acb9f6-e001-4031-bdb8-d2684fe032f0"],
 ". The trace (a pseudoscalar, the \"screw\" part) needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "l", "'"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "466330aa-b24c-44d7-9384-d4b684901869"],
 ", so at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"bae470c1-839e-4f47-b8f3-e7a187a82d16"],
 " the torque is ",
 StyleBox["traceless",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"b73bfa66-2496-42fb-9918-36d62df3a8a3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["One degree alone.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A single even degree is centrosymmetric at every order, so it gives no \
torque (Shape 1). A single odd degree first contributes at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "3"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"eb0a4c89-6856-43e8-9398-f8261c5c72ee"],
 ". For ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ecf25dac-9246-44fa-a08f-0613e190ddc5"],
 " the totally symmetric cubic coupling vanishes, and the symmetric part is \
pushed to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "5"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"7bbf3b6f-a0eb-459b-9b36-2bb464c4a67d"],
 " (Step 3 below)."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ac451184-367d-4530-84bd-dcaf8454f30b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Steps 1 to 3: single harmonics", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0d22c6c1-747d-4a7d-b640-c6ab756d2970"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Step 1, ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "1"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7d4ca749-b04b-46f7-bb0f-794f822dbea4"],
 StyleBox[": ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", "z"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "00ff10ce-c27c-435d-9b8b-9eca0219762b"],
 StyleBox[".",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " To first order this is the unit sphere displaced by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    OverscriptBox["z", "^"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "66228f0d-feb1-4c0a-a0b3-b496014aadfa"],
 ". The CoM moves with it, so nothing changes about the CoM. The engine is \
run to third order."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"119df3ad-330e-43ac-9013-8776763947ce"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sh1", "=", 
   RowBox[{"symbolicShape", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Rharm", "[", "z", "]"}], ",", "n", ",", "eps", ",", "3"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<CoM/l = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"TraditionalForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{"sh1", "[", "\"\<com\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], 
       ",", "\"\<     f_th/gamma0 = \>\"", ",", 
       RowBox[{"tf", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"sh1", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<f_th\>\"", 
         "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<l = 1\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<s = z: T_th = 0 about the CoM through O(eps^3); the CoM moves \
by eps\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"sh1", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<T_th\>\"", 
         "]"}], "]"}], "&&", 
       RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Coefficient", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sh1", "[", "\"\<com\>\"", "]"}], ",", "eps", ",", "1"}], 
          "]"}], "-", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   "}"}], "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f45a0bdb-bd6c-4196-bbc5-\
26c14212cbd7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TemplateBox[{"\"CoM/l = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"eps", "-", 
           FractionBox[
            RowBox[{"2", " ", 
              SuperscriptBox["eps", "3"]}], "5"]}]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm],
     TraditionalForm, Editable -> True], "\"     f_th/gamma0 = \"", 
   TagBox[
    FormBox[
     TagBox[
      RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", 
        GridBox[{{
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox[
              RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                SuperscriptBox["eps", "2"]}], "5"], "+", "1"}], "0", "0"}, {
          "0", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox[
              RowBox[{"3", " ", 
                SuperscriptBox["eps", "2"]}], "5"], "+", "1"}], "0"}, {
          "0", "0", 
           RowBox[{
             FractionBox[
              RowBox[{"4", " ", 
                SuperscriptBox["eps", "2"]}], "5"], "+", "1"}]}}, RowSpacings -> 
         1, ColumnSpacings -> 1, RowAlignments -> Baseline, ColumnAlignments -> 
         Center], "\[NoBreak]", ")"}], 
      Function[BoxForm`e$, 
       MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], TraditionalForm], TraditionalForm, Editable -> 
    True]},
  "RowDefault"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"bc34de95-4012-4209-9f69-\
c976acd8f402"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["\[Checkmark] VERIFIED",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15]],
 "    ",
 StyleBox["l = 1",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ":   ",
 "s = z: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["T", 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1ef76f6a-8d8d-4fcb-9b14-ac6c82d42208"],
 " = 0 about the CoM through O(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f583948a-c143-4a20-9971-bb947fa75f05"],
 "); the CoM moves by \[CurlyEpsilon]"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{4, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellMargins->{{66, 10}, {4, 4}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.92, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"bfa1dc37-0070-418c-a686-19324ce420db"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The anisotropy of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["f",
     FontWeight->"Bold"], 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4b034c53-86c4-46c9-a533-9017906cb526"],
 " at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"8b827d68-8a88-4b1c-b2e7-73c6dca1fb2a"],
 " is the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "969581ad-9673-49dd-9757-e20d5d1260e1"],
 " content of the displaced-sphere expansion, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", 
    StyleBox["cos",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[Theta]", " ", "="}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"136d28bb-0f5d-4cd3-9ff7-a65cd5695534"],
 " (sphere shifted by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "264d8c32-a2f9-4f69-8a29-963134bd8aef"],
 ") ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"+", " ", 
    FractionBox[
     SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], "2"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["sin",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], "2"], "\[Theta]", " ", "+", " ", "\[Ellipsis]"}], 
   TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->"b65aae79-5e65-44e3-8232-834d48238c7c"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e9873106-9ac3-4569-9084-f647ca8f4bce"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Step 2, ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "2"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "80df7af0-1e2d-4095-ac78-15c007f232a5"],
 StyleBox[": ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      OverscriptBox["n", "^"], "\[Transpose]"], 
     StyleBox["Q",
      FontWeight->"Bold"], 
     OverscriptBox["n", "^"]}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "de0a4e4f-f5d2-4b5f-b6eb-154008742ce3"],
 StyleBox[".",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " To first order this is the ellipsoid with semi-axes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", "\[CurlyEpsilon]", " ", 
    SubscriptBox["q", "i"]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2c945e94-ad52-4e37-afb6-e955fa180b7c"],
 " (the eigenvalues of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Q",
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "793a6080-4cf5-44a8-bf39-753f54ecbf8b"],
 "). Even at second order the shape is centrosymmetric, so the torque \
vanishes identically."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4568e7c0-0abe-438e-be58-b4032245d698"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Qg", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"qxx", ",", "qxy", ",", "qxz"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"qxy", ",", "qyy", ",", "qyz"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"qxz", ",", "qyz", ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "qxx"}], "-", "qyy"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sh2", "=", 
   RowBox[{"symbolicShape", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Rharm", "[", 
      RowBox[{"Y2", "[", "Qg", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "n", ",", "eps", ",", "2"}],
     "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"check", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\"\<l = 2\>\"", 
   ",", "\"\<s = n.Q.n (general Q): T_th = B = 0 and CoM = 0 through O(eps^2)\
\>\"", ",", 
   RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sh2", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<T_th\>\"", 
       "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"sh2", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<B\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"sh2", "[", "\"\<com\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
  "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"673e5fbf-65e3-4878-ac2c-3a7a4eb2cacb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["\[Checkmark] VERIFIED",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15]],
 "    ",
 StyleBox["l = 2",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ":   ",
 "s = n.Q.n (general Q): ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["T", 
    StyleBox["th",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "820161b7-2e90-4c53-bf49-a516eca12b9b"],
 " = B = 0 and CoM = 0 through O(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[CurlyEpsilon]", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7aefce23-e46c-4190-8541-bb83a9bdb636"],
 ")"
}], "Text",
 CellFrame->{{4, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellMargins->{{66, 10}, {4, 4}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0.1, 0.5, 0.15],
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.92, 0.97, 0.92],ExpressionUUID->"bc7bb3cb-8668-4e6c-8abf-d24710e95db0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Step 3, ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b6947361-da37-442d-a9b3-635b32fbf156"],
 StyleBox[": ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"s", " ", "=", " ", 
     SubscriptBox["\[Sum]", "m"], " ", 
     SubscriptBox["c", "m"], 
     SubscriptBox["Y", 
      RowBox[{"3", "m"}]]}],
    FontWeight->"Bold"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ee42e73b-c1b4-45ea-ba63-a63b3a4e9f4a"],
 StyleBox[", all seven components.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " At first order an ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"l", " ", "=", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4b47b131-36cf-4b56-a4af-fd574b072cdb"],
 " harmonic changes ",
 StyleBox["no",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " tensor at all, because no rank-2 tensor can be built linearly from it. At \
second order the product ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"3", " ", "\[Times]", " ", "3"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "910b595e-310c-455c-86bc-4afd8cfa4bbd"],
 " is even, so the torque still vanishes."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"35efa29e-bbf8-44cb-8fc1-bc42c4b9026b"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"cs", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Array", "[", 
    RowBox[{"c", ",", "7"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"sh3", "=", 
   RowBox[{"symbolicShape", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Rharm", "[", 
      RowBox[{"cs", ".", "Y3"}], "]"}], ",", "n", ",", "eps", ",", "2"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Column", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<l = 3, first order\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<an l = 3 harmonic leaves every tensor and the CoM unchanged \
at O(eps)\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Coefficient", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<f_th\>\"", 
            "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<f_drag\>\"",
             "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<T_drag\>\"",
             "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<B\>\"", 
            "]"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<com\>\"", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "eps", ",",
          "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"check", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<l = 3, second order\>\"", 
      ",", "\"\<T_th = 0 through O(eps^2) for a general l = 3 surface\>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"zeroQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sh3", "[", "\"\<blocks\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<T_th\>\"", 
        "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"68b1a5d3-0955-42cc-a61d-2da773a06ed7"],

